---
title: "Baton — UML Sequence: OAuth Connection Flow"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant Frontend as 🌐 baton-front
    participant API as ⚡ Baton API
    participant Encrypt as 🔒 EncryptionService
    participant Connector as 🔌 PlatformConnector
    participant DynamoDB as 🗄️ DynamoDB
    participant Platform as 📝 External Platform<br/>(Docusign / Zoho CRM /<br/>BambooHR / Smartsheet)

    Note over User,Platform: Step 1 — Initiate OAuth (admin session required)

    User->>Frontend: Click "Connect Docusign"
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/connections/docusign/authorize<br/>(baton_session cookie, requireAdmin)
    API->>Connector: authorize(orgId, userId)
    Connector->>Connector: Generate CSRF state<br/>(+ codeVerifier if connector uses PKCE)
    Connector-->>API: {redirectUrl, state, codeVerifier?}
    API->>DynamoDB: Store oauth-state<br/>{state, orgId, userId, platform,<br/>codeVerifier?, ttl: 10min}
    API-->>Frontend: {redirectUrl}
    Frontend->>Platform: Redirect to OAuth consent screen

    Note over User,Platform: Step 2 — User Grants Access

    User->>Platform: Approve access
    Platform->>API: Redirect browser to<br/>GET /api/connections/docusign/callback?code=xxx&state=yyy

    Note over User,Platform: Step 3 — Token Exchange

    API->>DynamoDB: Lookup oauth-state by state
    DynamoDB-->>API: {orgId, userId, platform, codeVerifier?}
    API->>DynamoDB: Delete oauth-state (one-time use)

    API->>Connector: handleCallback({code, state, codeVerifier?})
    Connector->>Platform: POST /oauth/token<br/>{code, client credentials, redirect_uri}
    Platform-->>Connector: {access_token, refresh_token,<br/>expires_in, scope}
    Connector-->>API: OAuthTokens

    Note over User,Platform: Step 4 — Secure Storage

    API->>API: Extract accountId + displayName<br/>from token response
    API->>API: Delete existing org+platform<br/>connection if reconnecting

    API->>Encrypt: encryptToken(accessToken)
    Encrypt-->>API: AES-256-GCM {ciphertext, iv, tag}
    API->>Encrypt: encryptToken(refreshToken)
    Encrypt-->>API: AES-256-GCM {ciphertext, iv, tag}

    API->>DynamoDB: PutItem → platform-connections<br/>{id, orgId, platform, status: "healthy",<br/>accessTokenEnc, refreshTokenEnc,<br/>tokenExpiresAt, scopes, accountId}
    API->>DynamoDB: PutItem → audit-log<br/>{action: "connection.created"}

    API-->>Frontend: Redirect to /connections?status=success
    Frontend-->>User: ✅ "Docusign connected!"

    Note over User,Platform: Later — Proactive Token Refresh (5 min cron)

    rect rgb(255, 249, 235)
        API->>DynamoDB: Scan connections where<br/>tokenExpiresAt within 15 min
        DynamoDB-->>API: [expiring connections]
        loop Each expiring connection
            API->>API: Enqueue TokenRefreshJob<br/>→ SQS token-refresh queue
            Note over API,Platform: TokenRefreshWorker picks up the job
            API->>Encrypt: decryptToken(refreshTokenEnc)
            Encrypt-->>API: refreshToken
            API->>Connector: refreshToken(refreshToken)
            Connector->>Platform: POST /oauth/token<br/>{grant_type: refresh_token}
            Platform-->>Connector: New tokens
            Connector-->>API: OAuthTokens
            API->>Encrypt: encryptToken(newAccessToken)
            API->>DynamoDB: Update connection tokens<br/>(re-encrypted)
        end
    end
